    "heading": "Level 3: Sorcerer Subclass",
    "lineStart": 4011,
    "lineEnd": 4013
  },
  "section": "3.260",
  "rulesText": "You gain a Sorcerer subclass of your choice. The Draconic Sorcery subclass is detailed after this class's description. A subclass is a specialization that grants you features at certain Sorcerer levels. For the rest of your career, you gain each of your subclass's features that are of your Sorcerer level or lower."
}
